OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content.
OL,9,FA motorcyclist found a dying man after
OL,10,Ffollowing a trail of blood for more
OL,11,Fthan a mile, a murder trial has heard.
OL,13,FAndrew Beasant-Roberts noticed the
OL,14,F"suspicious" trail after finding a
OL,15,Fdamaged bicycle in the road surrounded
OL,16,Fby confused witnesses who were unable
OL,17,Fto find the rider, shortly after 18:07
OL,18,FBST on 20 April.
